<title>JAPAN: Japan June domestic WPI up 2.0 pct yr/yr - BOJ.</title>
<headline>Japan June domestic WPI up 2.0 pct yr/yr - BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's domestic wholesale price index (WPI), a key component of the overall WPI, rose 2.0 percent in June from a year earlier, the Bank of Japan said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The following is a detailed breakdown of the June WPI:</p>
<p>Year-on-year (in percent)</p>
<p>		June	    May</p>
<p> Overall    +1.9	   +2.7</p>
<p> Domestic   +2.0	   +1.9</p>
<p> Exports    -0.9	   +3.7</p>
<p> Imports    +5.9	  +10.2</p>
<p>Month-on-month (in percent, index base year 1990):</p>
<p>		June	  May     Index</p>
<p> Overall    -0.7	  -0.7     94.4</p>
<p> Domestic   -0.1	  -0.1     97.0</p>
<p> Exports    -3.2	  -3.1     84.5</p>
<p> Imports    -3.2	  -3.4     84.0</p>
</text>
